    old "They say white flowers eventually bloomed where the two of them fell, side by side…{#ch5_8_v15352}"
    new "２人の落ちた地にはやがて寄り添うような白い花が咲いたといいます。"

translate japanese strings:
    old "She really looked like a princess. She seemed like a different person from the usual Tabitha.{#ch5_8_v8826}"
    new "なんか、本当のお姫さまみたいだったな。いつものタバサとは別人みたいだったし。"

translate japanese strings:
    old "Ladies and gentlemen, please give them one more grand round of applause!{#ch5_8_v15857}"
    new "それでは皆さま。最後にもう一度、盛大な拍手をお願いします！"

translate japanese strings:
    old "So confessions really happen.{#ch5_8_v15353}"
    new "告白って本当にあるんだ。"

translate japanese strings:
    old "W-what?{#ch5_8_v8827}"
    new "え、えっ？"

translate japanese strings:
    old "I've never seen one before.{#ch5_8_v15354}"
    new "初めて見た。"

translate japanese strings:
    old "Maybe I really meant it?{#ch5_8_v8828}"
    new "実は本気かも？"

translate japanese strings:
    old "Yes.{#ch5_8_v15355}"
    new "そう。"

translate japanese strings:
    old "When you just go along with it like that, it makes me sad.{#ch5_8_v8829}"
    new "そ、そんなふうに流されると悲しくなります。"

translate japanese strings:
    old "…Were you joking?{#ch5_8_v15356}"
    new "……冗談だったの？"

translate japanese strings:
    old "Huh? Huh?!{#ch5_8_v8830}"
    new "えっ？えっ？"

translate japanese strings:
    old "I-it was only a play!{#ch5_8_v8831}"
    new "お、お芝居だから！"

translate japanese strings:
    old "Yes. A play?{#ch5_8_v15357}"
    new "そう。お芝居？"

translate japanese strings:
    old "Ugh. Th-that… No, I mean…{#ch5_8_v8832}"
    new "うっ。そ、それは……。いや、その……。"

translate japanese strings:
    old "A-ahaha…{#ch5_8_v8833}"
    new "あ、あははは……。"

translate japanese strings:
    old "I dislike evasiveness.{#ch5_8_v15358}"
    new "誤魔化すの嫌い。"

translate japanese strings:
    old "No, I mean, well…{#ch5_8_v8834}"
    new "いや、あの、その……。"

translate japanese strings:
    old "A lie.{#ch5_8_v15359}"
    new "嘘。"
